      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA today announced the NVIDIA Vera CPU rack-scale platform for high-performance computing &mdash; combining NVIDIA&rsquo;s first fully custom data center CPU with the gold standard for HPC networking to drive extreme efficiency and throughput for state-of-the-art scientifi…",
