        "checkedAt": "2026-11-16T20:22:48.832Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "&ldquo;Scientific simulations need CPUs that can keep large datasets moving and sustain performance as applications scale,&rdquo; said Ian Buck, vice president of hyperscale and high-performance computing at NVIDIA. &ldquo;Vera brings custom CPU cores, high-bandwidth memory an…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-expands-vera-cpu-platform-to-accelerate-scientific-discovery",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-16T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-16T20:22:48.832Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Each Vera CPU features 88 custom NVIDIA Olympus cores, 176 threads and compact, serviceable SOCAMM2 LPDDR5X memory delivering up to 1.2TB/s of bandwidth to accelerate data-intensive scientific applications.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-expands-vera-cpu-platform-to-accelerate-scientific-discovery",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
